     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Proposing and dividing a task",
     "texto": [
      "To make a concrete proposal you can use **Vi kan …** («We can…»). **Hvem tar ansvar for …?** asks who takes responsibility for something; **Jeg kan ta …** lets you volunteer. When you finish, confirm the time and the agreed task."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
